sequenceDiagram
    actor Browser
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant Redis
    participant RS as RetrievalService
    participant Qdrant
    participant Cohere
    participant Claude as Claude Haiku 4.5

    Browser->>API: POST /api/chat/stream
    Note over API: RateLimitInterceptor — 5/min · 20/day per IP

    API->>Redis: GET session turn count
    alt Turn limit reached (15 turns)
        API-->>Browser: SSE limit message + done
    end

    API->>RS: retrieve(question, sessionId)

    Note over RS: 1 · Agent gate — QuestionClassifier (rule-based, first match wins)
    alt INVALID / OUT_OF_SCOPE / STRATEGIC / CONTACT_REDIRECT / PERSONAL
        RS-->>API: earlyReturn message
        API-->>Browser: SSE message + done
    end

    Note over RS: 2 · Query prep
    RS->>Redis: GET conversation history (last 2 turns)
    RS->>RS: extract focusCompany · resolve pronouns · sub-project query expansion

    Note over RS: 3 · Strategy select (RetrievalStrategySelector) + execute
    alt MULTI_COMPANY — career-spanning, no focus company
        loop Each known company
            RS->>Qdrant: Hybrid search (limit=2, company filter)
        end
        Qdrant-->>RS: per-company hits → enforce diversity (min 1 each)
    else BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL / STRATEGIC
        RS->>RS: QueryIntentClassifier → 1-3 intent_tags
        RS->>Qdrant: Hybrid search (RRF: must=company, should=intent_tags)
        Qdrant-->>RS: candidates
        RS->>Cohere: Rerank (rerank-v3.5, minScore cutoff, keep min 1)
        Cohere-->>RS: top-N
        RS->>RS: company allowlist filter (focus + siblings)
    else FACTUAL — temporal / profile
        RS->>Qdrant: Hybrid search (no rerank, BM25 favors dates/logistics)
        Qdrant-->>RS: top-N candidates
    else FACTUAL — experience
        RS->>Qdrant: Hybrid search
        Qdrant-->>RS: candidates
        RS->>Cohere: Rerank (no minScore, always top-N)
        Cohere-->>RS: top-N
        RS->>RS: company allowlist filter (focus + siblings)
    end

    RS-->>API: RetrievalResult (hits, context, questionType, focusCompany)

    alt No hits
        API-->>Browser: SSE no-hits message + done
    end

    API-->>Browser: SSE event:sources (chunk previews)
    API->>API: PromptBuilder.build (system + type + company + history + context + question)
    API->>Claude: Acquire throttle (bounded, fast-fail if saturated) → streaming generate
    loop Per token
        Claude-->>API: token
        API-->>Browser: SSE event:message
    end

    API->>Redis: Append Q&A to history (trim 2 turns, TTL 60min)
    API-->>Browser: SSE event:done
